00:25:41.280 --> 00:25:43.980
So for modernizing Windows
applications on GCP or .NET

00:25:43.980 --> 00:25:45.990
applications and GCP--

00:25:45.990 --> 00:25:48.570
so we provide a
number of instruments.

00:25:48.570 --> 00:25:51.840
We provide containers on
GCP that kind of helps

00:25:51.840 --> 00:25:53.550
you streamline the operations.

00:25:53.550 --> 00:25:57.270
And there have been multiple
sessions around that at Next.

00:25:57.270 --> 00:25:58.070
We provide .

00:25:58.070 --> 00:26:01.380
NET Client libraries
for all GCP APIs.

00:26:01.380 --> 00:26:07.050
So if you are a .NET developer
or your clients are .NET

00:26:07.050 --> 00:26:11.490
