00:26:27.000 --> 00:26:30.690
So once again, making sure
that the developer experience

00:26:30.690 --> 00:26:35.820
is seamless as they migrate from
other cloud platforms to GCP.

00:26:35.820 --> 00:26:40.500
And the last one is we have
