00:26:40.500 --> 00:26:44.190
our Stackdriver technologies
are integrated into the .NET

00:26:44.190 --> 00:26:45.090
Platform.

00:26:45.090 --> 00:26:47.730
So you have much more
visibility into what's going on

00:26:47.730 --> 00:26:53.750
and what's working, which
is working not on GCP.

